= Daily Task List

This Daily Task List (DTL) is to be kept at the main desk within the department.

At the beginning of each day, the first employee on shift should review the schedule and evenly assign tasks to all scheduled team members. Once a task is completed, the employee should initial the corresponding section and add any relevant notes.

